{"seq":3,"slug":"indirect-saving-compliance-kpi","title":"间接采购节省/合规率与品类 KPI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/indirect-budget-settlement/indirect-saving-compliance-kpi","wordCount":2082,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"间接采购节省-合规率与品类-kpi\">间接采购节省/合规率与品类 KPI</h1><p>采购部门每年汇报「今年节省了 1200 万」，这句话的可靠性取决于三个未说出口的前提：相对于什么基准省的、这个基准是不是可信的、以及省下来的钱是纸面的还是真进了账。<strong>大多数「虚假节省」不是刻意造假，而是基准选择与口径定义的问题</strong>。这一篇专门讲怎么把节省与合规这两个最容易被玩坏的数字定义得可核验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-节省的三种基准\">核心概念：节省的三种基准</h2><p>节省额的定义式都是同一个形式：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>savings</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>基准单价</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>实际单价</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mtext>数量</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{savings} = (\\text{基准单价} - \\text{实际单价}) \\times \\text{数量}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">savings</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">基准单价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际单价</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">数量</span></span></span></span></span></span>。真正决定这个数字含义的是基准单价取哪一个。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基准类型</th>\n<th>基准单价来源</th>\n<th>可信度</th>\n<th>主要缺陷</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预算基准</td>\n<td>年初预算中的假设价</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>预算价可以主观设高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史价格基准</td>\n<td>上一个可比期间的加权均价</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n<td>品类变化时不可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>招标/竞争基准</td>\n<td>本轮询价的最低价或次低价</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>需要真实竞争过程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>市场指数基准</td>\n<td>公开市场价格指数</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>与具体规格难对齐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"为什么预算基准必须被排除\">为什么预算基准必须被排除</h3><p><strong>预算基准最不可信</strong>，因为它有循环激励：编制预算时把假设价写得越高，来年越容易报出漂亮的节省。因此成熟的采购组织不用预算价作为节省基准，而用历史价格或招标结果。<strong>历史价格基准</strong>的可比性依赖于规格相同，因此必须按 SKU 或规格族匹配，混品类计算会得出无意义的数。<strong>招标基准</strong>最硬，但只覆盖走过招标的部分，覆盖率天然低。</p>\n<p>招标基准之所以硬，是因为它有真实竞争过程作为证据。采购端的三类征询文书各自解决的问题不同：<strong>RFI</strong>（信息征询）用来摸清市场上有哪些产品与供应商、不构成邀标也不对双方产生约束；<strong>RFQ</strong>（报价征询）用在规格已经确定、价格是主要甚至唯一决定因素时；<strong>RFP</strong>（方案征询）用在规格未定、需要供应商提出自己的方案时，它本身被视为一种反向拍卖式的采购文书（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Request_for_proposal\">Request for proposal</a>）。对节省额计算的含义是：只有 RFQ 与 RFP 的结果可以作为价格基准，RFI 的回复只是市场情报，用它当基准等于拿供应商的口头预估当既成事实。</p>\n<p>一个可执行的原则是：<strong>节省必须按「可比单元」计算并逐条留痕</strong>。所谓可比单元，就是「同一品类、同一规格、同一计量单位」的一次价格变化。做不到可比就不计入节省，宁可少报也不虚报——虚报的节省会在下一次预算谈判时被对方用作依据，产生实质损失。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>verified_savings</mtext><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>comparable</mtext></mrow></munder><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>base_price</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mtext>actual_price</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{verified\\_savings} = \\sum_{i \\in \\text{comparable}} (\\text{base\\_price}_i - \\text{actual\\_price}_i) \\times q_i \\times \\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">verified_savings</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4882em;vertical-align:-1.4382em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">comparable</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base_price</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.102em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3403em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3597em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1097em;vertical-align:-0.3597em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">actual_price</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.102em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3403em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3597em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>α</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该笔采购的<strong>实现率</strong>——节省只有在实际采购量发生时才算实现，签了协议但没人按协议采购，节省是零。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 节省必须按可比单元计算，且实现量决定实现额&#10;CREATE TABLE saving_record (&#10;  saving_id       BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  category_id     VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL REFERENCES indirect_category(category_id),&#10;  legal_entity_id VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  baseline_kind   VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- budget / historical / tender / index&#10;  baseline_ref    TEXT NOT NULL,          -- 基准来源单据或快照号，必须可查&#10;  baseline_price  NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  actual_price    NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  qty_realized    NUMERIC(18,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  currency        CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  period          CHAR(7) NOT NULL,&#10;  verified        BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,&#10;  verified_by     BIGINT REFERENCES principal(principal_id),&#10;  note            TEXT&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW v_savings_realized AS&#10;SELECT category_id, legal_entity_id, period, baseline_kind,&#10;       SUM((baseline_price - actual_price) * qty_realized) AS savings_amount,&#10;       COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE qty_realized = 0)           AS zero_realization_count&#10;FROM saving_record&#10;WHERE verified AND actual_price &lt; baseline_price&#10;GROUP BY category_id, legal_entity_id, period, baseline_kind;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 节省必须按可比单元计算，且实现量决定实现额</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> saving_record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  saving_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> indirect_category(category_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  legal_entity_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  baseline_kind   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- budget / historical / tender / index</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  baseline_ref    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 基准来源单据或快照号，必须可查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  baseline_price  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  actual_price    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty_realized    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">18</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  period</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verified        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> FALSE,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  verified_by     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> principal(principal_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  note            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> v_savings_realized</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_id, legal_entity_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, baseline_kind,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((baseline_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual_price) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty_realized) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> savings_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> qty_realized </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> zero_realization_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> saving_record</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> verified </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> actual_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline_price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_id, legal_entity_id, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, baseline_kind;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>verified</code> 与 <code>verified_by</code> 是关键设计：节省额在录入时是未验证状态，只有独立于录入者的人核对过基准来源后才计入已实现节省。这是 Doer 与 Judge 分离在线下流程里的对应——同一个数字不能既是「谈出来的」又是「证明了是真的」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[识别价格变化] --&gt; B{可比单元?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[不计入节省]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[选择基准类型]&#10;  D --&gt; E[记录基准来源单据]&#10;  E --&gt; F[关联实际采购量]&#10;  F --&gt; G{实际量 &gt; 0?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[未实现, 不计入]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[独立复核基准与量]&#10;  I --&gt; J{复核通过?}&#10;  J --&gt;|否| C&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[计入已实现节省]&#10;  K --&gt; L[按品类/主体/期间聚合]\">graph TD\n  A[识别价格变化] --&gt; B{可比单元?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[不计入节省]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[选择基准类型]\n  D --&gt; E[记录基准来源单据]\n  E --&gt; F[关联实际采购量]\n  F --&gt; G{实际量 &gt; 0?}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[未实现, 不计入]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[独立复核基准与量]\n  I --&gt; J{复核通过?}\n  J --&gt;|否| C\n  J --&gt;|是| K[计入已实现节省]\n  K --&gt; L[按品类/主体/期间聚合]</pre><h2 id=\"合规率的定义陷阱\">合规率的定义陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"三个必须同时选定的口径\">三个必须同时选定的口径</h3><p>合规率（compliance rate）看起来简单——「按规矩做的比例」，实际有三个必须选定的口径，选错就完全失去指导意义。</p>\n<p><strong>分子选谁</strong>：是「走了系统的采购笔数」「走系统且用了协议供应商的笔数」，还是「走系统且用协议供应商且审批齐全的笔数」？三者严格程度递增。多数组织采用中间口径，因为「用了协议供应商」是真正的价值所在（节省与质量都来自这里），而审批是否齐全更多是内控问题。</p>\n<p><strong>分母选谁</strong>：是「全部间接支出」，还是「有协议覆盖的品类支出」？前者会被无协议品类的正常线下采购拉低，产生虚假的差业绩；后者更聚焦但需要先能算出协议覆盖率。这二者就是 <a href=\"../indirect-spend-category/indirect-spend-visibility-maverick\">间接支出可视性与散单识别</a> 里散单率的另一个视角——<code>合规率 = 1 - 散单率</code>（在同样口径下）。</p>\n<p><strong>按什么聚合</strong>：按金额还是按笔数？按金额更反映财务影响，按笔数更反映行为渗透。两者都要看：金额合规率高而笔数合规率低，说明员工只在大额上走系统、小额全部绕开，这正是最典型的形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"品类-kpi-的组合与反噬\">品类 KPI 的组合与反噬</h2><p>单一指标必然被优化，因此品类 KPI 必须是组合，且组合里要有互相制衡的项。四个基本项及其反噬方向如下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>KPI</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>单独追求会怎样</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>节省额</td>\n<td>相对基准的价格下降</td>\n<td>压低单价换取质量下降或供应商减少</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合规率</td>\n<td>走系统且用协议供应商的金额占比</td>\n<td>强制走系统导致体验恶化、转为更隐蔽的绕行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商数量</td>\n<td>品类内活跃供应商数</td>\n<td>过度精简导致断供风险上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>采购周期</td>\n<td>请购提交到订单发出的时长</td>\n<td>为抢时间跳过校验</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三项与第四项是制衡项。<strong>供应商数量</strong>约束过度精简：把 40 家供应商砍到 2 家确实能降单价，但失去议价余地与断供缓冲，因此精简目标应当按 <a href=\"../indirect-supplier-contract/frame-agreement-catalog-supplier\">框架协议与目录供应商管理</a> 中的关键度分级设定，而不是一刀切。<strong>采购周期</strong>约束过度管控：如果为了让合规率好看而增加校验步数，周期会变长，而周期变长的下一站就是散单率上升——四个指标构成一个闭环，任何一个被单独拉满都会在另一个上还回来。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基准不可比时的处理\">基准不可比时的处理</h3><p>规格发生变化（换型号、改包装、调整服务等级）时价格不可比，此时合理的做法是<strong>用总拥有成本而非单价比较</strong>，或标记为「不可比，不计入节省」。把不可比的都算成节省，是节省数字失去公信力的最快途径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"节省与预算的关系\">节省与预算的关系</h3><p>已实现节省不会自动变成可花的钱，只有<strong>预算里相应下调了额度</strong>，节省才真正落到损益表。因此成熟的流程会把已实现节省反馈到下一期预算编制：节省记录按品类与主体聚合，作为下调预算的依据。若节省数字不进入预算，就无法验证它的真实性，也会让业务方觉得「省了也白省」。这一条把本篇与 <a href=\"cost-center-budget-control\">成本中心/项目预算与超额审批</a> 的预算编制闭环连了起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>节省额的可信度由基准类型决定，预算基准最低、招标基准最高；节省必须按可比单元逐条留痕并区分录入与复核；合规率必须同时选定额分子、分母与聚合方式三个口径，且与散单率是同一枚硬币的两面；品类 KPI 必须是四项组合，其中供应商数量与采购周期是制衡项；已实现节省只有反馈到下一期预算才有实际意义。这套度量口径的输入全部来自前三章建立的数据模型——品类口径、单据链与协议价——口径不统一则本节所有公式都无法得出可核验的结果。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>节省基准按可信度排序：招标 &gt; 历史价格 &gt; 市场指数 &gt; 预算</li>\n<li>节省按可比单元留痕，录入与复核分离；合规率需同时选定分子、分母、聚合方式</li>\n<li>KPI 必须成组，供应商数量与采购周期是防单指标反噬的制衡项</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"间接采购节省/合规率与品类 KPI","id":"间接采购节省-合规率与品类-kpi"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：节省的三种基准","id":"核心概念-节省的三种基准"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么预算基准必须被排除","id":"为什么预算基准必须被排除"},{"level":2,"text":"合规率的定义陷阱","id":"合规率的定义陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"三个必须同时选定的口径","id":"三个必须同时选定的口径"},{"level":2,"text":"品类 KPI 的组合与反噬","id":"品类-kpi-的组合与反噬"},{"level":3,"text":"基准不可比时的处理","id":"基准不可比时的处理"},{"level":3,"text":"节省与预算的关系","id":"节省与预算的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"自用物资采购的税费/进口处理（边界156/188）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/mro-indirect-procurement/indirect-budget-settlement/indirect-tax-import-office-goods"},"next":null}